*1 [[Zang Roo]] spawns after 100 seconds<sup>3,000f</sup>.

==Strategy==
This stage includes some tough Zombie enemies, so beware of the challenge.

Two meatshields should suffice for defense, however if you have [[Wushu Cat (Rare Cat)|Sifu Cat]] you can use him to keep the Zombies at bay, effectively removing almost all the challenge in the stage. Ranged attackers like [[Lizard Cat (Normal Cat)|King Dragon Cat]]/[[Gross Cat (Normal Cat)|Macho Leg Cat]], or even better, an anti-Zombie attacker like [[Vaulter Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Polevaulter Cat]] are an effective way to deal with the Zir Zeals when they burrow. You will have to deal with them a second time unless you [[Zombie Killer|Zombie Kill]] them though, so use any units currently accessible to Z-Kill if possible.

